<title>USA: Woolworth CFO Andrew Hines resigns.</title>
<headline>Woolworth CFO Andrew Hines resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woolworth Corp said on Wednesday that Andrew Hines, its chief financial officer and senior vice-president, would resign effective April 30.</p>
<p>The company said he would be leaving pursue other personal interests and that it expects to name a successor shortly.</p>
</text>
